  "item_short_desc": "<p>Meet your every storage need with Rothco&rsquo;s Large Transport Pack, a tactical marvel featuring MOLLE compatibility and hydration-ready design. This heavy-duty polyester pack, measuring approximately 19 inches x 15 inches x 8 inches, offers a range of features for the most demanding adventures. The large main compartment, equipped with heavy-duty zippers, extends the bag's length for easy access and storage. Stay hydrated on the go with the hydration bladder-compatible pouch.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
