  "description": "<p>Meet your every storage need with Rothco&rsquo;s Large Transport Pack, a tactical marvel featuring MOLLE compatibility and hydration-ready design. This heavy-duty polyester pack, measuring approximately 19 inches x 15 inches x 8 inches, offers a range of features for the most demanding adventures. The large main compartment, equipped with heavy-duty zippers, extends the bag's length for easy access and storage. Stay hydrated on the go with the hydration bladder-compatible pouch, while the water-repellent coating on lining and pockets keeps your essentials dry. The adjustable padded shoulder straps with quick-release buckles ensure comfort and emergency readiness. A removable waist belt aids weight distribution and pack stabilization. The MOLLE compatibility allows you to attach additional pouches and accessories for personalized functionality. Designed for versatility, this transport pack includes a front zippered compartment with an exterior pouch, a padded mesh back for added comfort and ventilation, and a quick-release top and side adjustable web straps. The pack also features a drag handle and cinch straps for secure closure. Choose Rothco&rsquo;s Large Transport Pack for unparalleled storage options and reliable performance on your next adventure.</p>",
